# Planning the team trip
Three cities, one week, twelve people

notes:
  Welcome everyone.
  The budget is on the last slide.

---

section: Where we go

## Three cities
- Lisbon
- Porto
- Coimbra

notes:
  Ask who has been to any of them.

---

## Why these three
They are connected by train, so nobody has to drive.

---

section: How we get there

slide: background=night transition=fade

## By train
1. Lisbon to Coimbra: 1 h 40 min
2. Coimbra to Porto: 1 h

notes:
  Tickets are cheaper two weeks in advance.

  Mention the bike carriages.

---

section: Budget

## What it costs
| Item | Per person |
|---|---|
| Train | 60 € |
| Hotels | 420 € |
